Subject: [PATCH 1/9] Custody kernel in the rules (workstream 10)

permutation-rules/src/frontier/custody.rs is generated from
workstreams/10-custody/custody/src/{lot,layout}.rs (the tested source)
by workstreams/10-custody/scripts/core-kernel.py: lots, two-phase
orders, inbound reservations, forfeiture after a seizure, losses by
cause, the byte layout of a Lot.

The S1 ruleset (KERNEL_VERSIONS_V3, RULESET_HASH_V3) is unchanged:
custody is bound by a new KERNEL_VERSIONS_V4 / ruleset_hash_v4 (rules
version 13), which no program embeds yet. The guard that every module
of the tree is bound now checks the newest list.

